      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The Gazette stopped mentioning victims by name after June. I have sufficient
    names and dates, however, to trace back to the first case. Unfortunately, there
    are all jumbled together so I should put them in order first. There are five
    people. I should find their name and surname (if it exists), their address, and
    the date they showed symptoms. Each entry should include only one, unique value.\r\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ca56ab392655da042978212b37cc216d, type: 2}
