  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "> The last named case was the 31st of May.\r\n> The <link=Additional_3><u><color=blue>black
    girl</link></u></color> did not live in Strada Mercanti.\r\n> Schembri is the
    last name of the second case.\r\n> Salvatore got symptoms before the person whose
    last name is Re.\r\n> Ubaldisca is the name of the person who lived in Strada
    Santa Orsola.\r\n> Cremona got symptoms after Aloisia.\r\n> Borg lived in Strada
    San Paolo.\r\n> The person who lived in Strada Spedale got symptoms second before
    last.\r\n> Salvatore did not live in Strada San Giovanni.\r\n> The second case
    was recorded on the 16th of May and it was not Anna.\r\n> Anna, whose last name
    was not Re, lived in Strada Mercanti.\r\n> The first case was recorded 28 days
    before the last but not in Strada Giovanni.\r\n> Borg was not the third person
    who got symptoms on the 17th of May and before Aloisia.\r\n> The black girl got
    symptoms ten days before the second to last case.\r\n> The person who lived in
    Strada San Giovanni got symptoms before Re.\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ca56ab392655da042978212b37cc216d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 7740920288453101596, guid: ca56ab392655da042978212b37cc216d, type: 2}
