  m_text: I cannot help but notice that while all other victims are mentioned by
    name and surname, this person is only referred to as a black girl [<link=Image_black_girl><u><color=blue>una
    ragazza negra</link></u></color>]. History does have prejudices we should not
    be blind to. At the same time, it is important to preserve these records in order
    to overcome historical prejudices.
